        <mxCell id="x6" parent="x_b" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#202124;fillColor=#ffe2c0;strokeColor=#e59945;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6f6f6f&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;X6&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Layout model, page by page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;pymupdf_layout 1.28.2 in its own worker process. Finds regions and reading order. Table-cell rebuild is off.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;NeuralPageReader&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
