        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x15" parent="x_d" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#202124;fillColor=#eee5f5;strokeColor=#aa81c5;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6f6f6f&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;X15&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Split into child chunks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Max 1,200 characters including the Paper / Section prefix. Overlap 120. Splits at paragraph, line, sentence, then word. No text at all (a scan; OCR is off): skip the paper.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;split_sections_into_chunks()&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="166" width="250" x="16" y="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x16" parent="x_d" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#202124;fillColor=#ffe2c0;strokeColor=#e59945;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6f6f6f&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;X16&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Embed children&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;EmbeddingGemma, 768 dimensions, batches of 16. Finishes before any write, so a failure leaves the old paper searchable.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;embed_document_chunks()&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="132" width="250" x="16" y="214" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x17" parent="x_d" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#202124;fillColor=#eee5f5;strokeColor=#aa81c5;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6f6f6f&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;X17&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Build records&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Chunk ID + parent_id link a child to its section. Adds title, link, location, pages. Parent vector = mean of its children.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="118" width="250" x="16" y="376" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x18" parent="x_d" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#202124;fillColor=#eee5f5;strokeColor=#aa81c5;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6f6f6f&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;X18&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Write + clean up&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Upsert sections and chunks. Delete old IDs and papers no longer in the manifest.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;index_research_paper()&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="108" width="250" x="16" y="528" as="geometry" />
